eps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2015-08-04T16:02:59Z","updated_at":"2018-02-07T00:45:43Z","closed_at":"2015-08-07T13:47:47Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I've occasionally run ESLint on [JSON5's test cases](https://github.com/aseemk/json5/tree/master/test/parse-cases) (forgot to add `node_modules` to `.eslintignore`), and it failed. [The test case](https://github.com/aseemk/json5/blob/master/test/parse-cases/arrays/leading-comma-array.js) was:\n\n``` js\n[\n    ,null\n]\n```\n\nMy `.eslintrc` file is:\n\n``` yaml\nrules:\n  quotes: [2, \"double\"]\nenv:\n  es6: true\n  node: true\n  browser: true\nextends: [\"xo-space\", \"xo-react\"]\n```\n\nAnd the output is:\n\n```\n/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/rules/indent.js:211\n        if (elements.length > 0 && elements[0].loc.start.line === node.loc.sta\n                                              ^\nTypeError: Cannot read property 'loc' of null\n    at checkIndentInArrayOrObjectBlock (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/rules/indent.js:211:47)\n    at EventEmitter.ArrayExpression (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/rules/indent.js:404:13)\n    at EventEmitter.emit (events.js:129:20)\n    at Controller.controller.traverse.enter (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/eslint.js:794:25)\n    at Controller.__execute (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/node_modules/estraverse/estraverse.js:397:31)\n    at Controller.traverse (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/node_modules/estraverse/estraverse.js:495:28)\n    at EventEmitter.module.exports.api.verify (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/eslint.js:787:24)\n    at processText (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:200:27)\n    at processFile (/home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:225:12)\n    at /home/ale/dev/Songbee/bee-app/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:321:26\n```\n\nThe case is a bit weird, I agree, but it's still a valid JS code.\n","closed_by":{"login":"gyandeeps","id":5554486,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTQ0ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5554486?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps","html_url":"https://github.com/gyandeeps","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyandeeps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/3272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/3272/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}